			"notes": "## 1.0.2 (2025-07-05)\n\nYes it has new features even though it's a minor release. I couldn't help myself. It also breaks existing road textures, sorry (but it's future proof now!)\n\n### Features\n\n* #20 Thicker Sign Posts\n* #17 More road textures \n* #21 Multiple road base textures (specifically concrete roads, more might come in the future)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* [#18](https://github.com/derfl007/dfroads-repaved/issues/18) Sync block entity updates between clients ([8949f0b](https://github.com/derfl007/dfroads-repaved/commit/8949f0b5a4fc7c3cd75e36ac80a3d8df81e3e51d))\n* #22 Complex road sign GUI issues\n* #18 Road signs not syncing between players\n* #19 Rendering issues, especially noticeable with sodium and iris"
		},
